<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the Australian Hardcourt Championships on Tuesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Galo Blanco (Spain) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Jeff Salzenstein (U.S.)  6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat 3-Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>8-Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Nicolas Pereira (Venezuela) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Scott Draper (Australia) beat Alex Radulescu (Germany) 6-3 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Niklas Kulti (Sweden) 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Sandon Stolle (Australia) 6-1 4-6 6-0.</p>
</text>
